msgid "Pretty Feeds"
msgstr ""

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: pretty-feeds.php
msgid "https://github.com/pfefferle/wordpress-pretty-feeds"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: pretty-feeds.php
msgid ""
"Styles an RSS/Atom feed, making it friendly for humans viewers, and adds a "
"link to aboutfeeds.com for new user onboarding."
msgstr ""
"Gestaltet einen RSS-/Atom-Feed lesefreundlich für menschliche Besucherinnen "
"und Besucher und ergänzt einen Link zu aboutfeeds.com für den Einstieg neuer "
"Nutzerinnen und Nutzer."

#. Author of the plugin
#: pretty-feeds.php
msgid "Matthias Pfefferle"
msgstr ""

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: pretty-feeds.php
msgid "https://notiz.blog/"
msgstr ""

#: pretty-feeds.php:154
msgid ""
"Thanks for reading this post via RSS. RSS is great, and you’re great for "
"using it. ♥️"
msgstr ""
"Danke, dass du diesen Beitrag über RSS liest. RSS ist großartig – und du "
"bist großartig, weil du es nutzt. ♥️"

#: pretty-feeds.php:155
msgid ""
"Congratulations on being an RSS reader! You are part of an elite group of "
"people who know how to stay updated in style."
msgstr ""
"Glückwunsch, du liest per RSS! Du gehörst zu einer kleinen, feinen Gruppe, "
"die stilvoll auf dem Laufenden bleibt."

#: pretty-feeds.php:156
msgid ""
"Hey there, RSS reader! You’re one of a special few, choosing this old-school "
"yet awesome way of staying informed. Kudos!"
msgstr ""
"Hey, RSS-Fan! Du gehörst zu den wenigen Besonderen, die diesen altbewährten "
"und trotzdem großartigen Weg wählen, um informiert zu bleiben. Hut ab!"

#: pretty-feeds.php:157
msgid ""
"You are a true RSS aficionado! While others are drowning in social media "
"noise, you enjoy the simplicity and control of RSS. Congrats!"
msgstr ""
"Du bist ein echter RSS-Profi! Während andere im Lärm der sozialen Medien "
"untergehen, genießt du die Einfachheit und Kontrolle von RSS. Glückwunsch!"

#: pretty-feeds.php:158
msgid ""
"RSS readers like you are the unsung heroes of the internet. Keep up the good "
"work!"
msgstr ""
"RSS-Fans wie du sind die unbesungenen Heldinnen und Helden des Internets. "
"Weiter so!"

#: pretty-feeds.php:159
msgid ""
"You are a master of efficiency! By using RSS, you save time and avoid "
"distractions. 👏"
msgstr ""
"Du bist ein Effizienz-Profi! Mit RSS sparst du Zeit und vermeidest "
"Ablenkungen. 👏"

#: pretty-feeds.php:160
msgid ""
"RSS readers like you are the secret sauce of the internet. Keep rocking and "
"staying informed!"
msgstr ""
"RSS-Fans wie du sind die Geheimzutat des Internets. Bleib großartig und "
"bestens informiert!"

#: pretty-feeds.php:161
msgid "Hey there, RSS reader! You’re cool. Keep being awesome! 😎"
msgstr "Hey, RSS-Fan! Du bist cool. Bleib einfach großartig! 😎"

#: assets/js/pretty-feed.js:213
msgid "RSS feed icon"
msgstr "RSS-Feed-Symbol"

#: assets/js/pretty-feed.js:221
msgid "Web Feed"
msgstr "Web-Feed"

#. translators: %1$s: opening link tag to subscribe to the feed; %2$s: closing link tag.
#: assets/js/pretty-feed.js:243
msgid ""
"<strong>Look at you, following along the old-school way.</strong> Subscribe "
"by copy-pasting the URL into your feed reader, or by clicking %1$shere%2$s..."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Sieh dich an, ganz old-school unterwegs.</strong> Abonniere den "
"Feed, indem du die URL in deinen Feed-Reader kopierst oder %1$shier%2$s "
"klickst ..."

#. translators: %1$s: opening link tag to aboutfeeds.com; %2$s: closing link tag.
#: assets/js/pretty-feed.js:258
msgid ""
"Visit %1$sAbout Feeds%2$s to get started with newsreaders and subscribing. "
"It’s free."
msgstr ""
"Besuche %1$sAbout Feeds%2$s, um mit Newsreadern und dem Abonnieren zu "
"starten. Es ist kostenlos."

#: assets/js/pretty-feed.js:278
msgid "Visit Website"
msgstr "Website besuchen"

#: assets/js/pretty-feed.js:283
msgid "Recent Items"
msgstr "Neueste Einträge"

#: assets/js/pretty-feed.js:289
msgid "Published:"
msgstr "Veröffentlicht:"
